\**{c=red:Note:}** This Mission requires the completion of the {M:Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions|Treasures of Aht Urhgan Missions} storyline.
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {p:Naja Salaheem} in {p:Aht Urghan Whitegate} (I-10) for a cutscene to begin the Mission.
** The right one starts with Naja singing to herself and talking about A.M.A.N.
* Head to {z:Wajaom Woodlands} (H-13) and select the glowing **Savage Scars** behind the __{p:Engraved Tablet}__, for a cutscene.
** Use Survival guide warp to {z:Aydeewa Subterrane} or Unity warp 125 for {z:Wajaom Woodlands} for faster travel.
* Select the **Savage Scars** again to battle the **Returned Soulflayer** (BLU), with a 15 minute time limit.
** Has approximately 100k HP.
** Can use both {p:Azure Lore} and {p:Unbridled Learning}.
*** Under {p:Azure Lore} it will spam a variety of spells, including:
**** Water Bomb: AoE {@g:Element: Water|Water} damage and silence.
**** Firespit: {@g:Element: Fire|Fire} damage.
**** Zephyr Mantle: Blink.
**** Spinal Cleave: {@g:Physical Damage|Physical} Damage
**** Sinker Drill: {@g:Physical Damage|Physical} Damage.
**** Yawn: AoE {@g:Element: Light|Light} sleepga.
**** Restoral: Self-cure
**** Exuviation: Cure and erase.
**** Hysteric Barrage: {@g:Physical Damage|Physical} Damage.
*** Under {p:Unbridled Learning} it will spam a variety of spells, including:
**** Tourbillion: Defense Down
**** Bloodrake: HP Drain
**** Pyric Bulwark: Negates next physical attack.
**** Gates of Hades: AoE {@g:Element: Fire|Fire} damage and burn.
*** Is able to be silenced by a well geared RDM, negating the spells during Azure Lore
** May use Mind Purge, removing all buffs on a single player.
* Select the **Savage Scars** again for a cutscene and to receive a {@k} {k:Lock of golden hair}.
* Return to speak with {p:Naja Salaheem} again in {p:Aht Urghan Whitegate} (I-10) for your rewards.
** You will obtain the Ziamet armor set.

\**NOTE**: If you want to come back later and replay the Whitegate based cutscenes from this mission or any of the upcoming ones, speak to {n:Tsih Kolgimih} (near the entrance to Al Zahbi) and look under the __Rhapsodies of Vana'diel__ menu.
]=],
